    "open_questions": [
      "His kit in 1976-77: the make and sizes were not found in any source read. The Pretty Vacant video shows a black kit, one tom, a floor tom and chrome hardware.",
      "Bodies' intro: the floor tom and kick at 127 before the song's 158 - a tempo change on the record, or a separate edit?",
      "Who cites him: no drummer naming Cook as an influence was found in what was read; look in Modern Drummer, Rhythm and punk histories (Jon Savage's England's Dreaming, Clinton Heylin's Never Mind the Bollocks).",
      "Read Steve Jones's Lonely Boy (2016) and Lydon's books for accounts of the drum sessions."
    ]
